==Battleground==
*1 [[Elder Sloth]] spawns as the boss.
*1 [[THE SLOTH]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*20 [[Elder Sloth]]s spawn after 160 seconds<sup>4,800f</sup>, delay 0.67~1.33 seconds<sup>20f~40f</sup>.

==Strategy==
If you haven't gotten ALL [[Into the Future]] treasures, you will NOT beat this stage. ITF treasures are a must for this stage. Even missing one of them will buff the Elder Sloth to 1.44m health and 50k damage, making him impossible to defeat before 20 more of him spawn.

With treasures, bringing Alien specialists such as [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]] will make it much easier to quickly defeat the Elder Sloth. Other than that, it's essentially a game of having enough DPS to defeat both enemies and destroy the base before the rest of the Elder Sloths spawn. So, cats such as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] are very useful. Additionally, cats with Knockback against Traitless and Alien might allow you to push back the enemies rather than actually defeating them. [[Metal Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Metal Cat]] is also useful for making sure neither sloth gains any ground.

